's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"34e3e2cc466f0651d9247bfeeaa4ffbe","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"28233101b4bb44f300c4f4236ff5c71f","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"edd2fd0f3e0da371b0b103e07f96d6e0","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"840396b3e8660cfcd7ff18202cfcd56c","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"7cb1122426fca17d2247a2672d707721","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"f38967fde8f2780d25d65789da86c80a","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"529033edc706414f782afa28ce17acce","originalFileName":"e8bbb7c9-9c24-42b7-942a-568bba9a8c3b-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"e6849785d6fdd8e91dec1090f887f0c9","